## 2. The product you should build now

### 2.1 Main product sentence

```text
Empyralis is an AI operator for real business work: it lives in chat, connects to your apps and channels, and can use approved computers or hosted machines under policy, approvals, and audit.
```

Shorter:

```text
An AI operator that works from your chat, apps, and approved computers.
```

Even more practical for pilots:

```text
An AI customer operator for Telegram and WhatsApp businesses.
```

### 2.2 First wedge

Start with:

```text
Telegram-first AI customer operator for small businesses.
```

Why:

```text
Telegram is easier than WhatsApp.
Your repo already has Telegram personal gateway runtime and session persistence under gateway state.
Telegram demo is easy to understand.
The gateway advantage becomes obvious.
Cost is controllable.
```

First demo:

```text
1. Business owner connects Telegram.
2. Uploads FAQ, pricing, product, refund, and policy docs.
3. Installs Customer Support Operator recipe.
4. Chooses autonomy mode: draft-only, safe autopilot, or approval-required.
