## 9. Hardware/VPS strategy

### 9.1 Minimum cost strategy

Use:

```text
1GB VPS only for Telegram-lightweight gateway pilots.
2GB VPS as practical hosted gateway minimum.
4GB VPS for WhatsApp/browser-lite.
8GB+ for serious business hosted Agent Computer.
```

Worker strategy:

```text
Gateway stays alive.
Heavy worker sleeps.
Browser worker sleeps.
Model/API calls happen only when needed.
```

### 9.2 User-provided hardware

Use for:

```text
local files
local desktop apps
private/local workflows
power users
self-hosted customers
```

Do not promise invisibility from the user on their own machine.

### 9.3 Company-provided hosted hardware

Use for:

```text
pilot customers
normal users
always-on Telegram
business customer support
WhatsApp dedicated container later
```

No user SSH. Only UI controls.

### 9.4 Dedicated managed hardware later

Use for:

```text
premium businesses
high reliability
private deployments
enterprise pilots
```

